    [4112]={name="Choker of the High Shaman",quality=2,ilvl=44,reqLevel=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mok'thardin's Enchantment'. Starts with Far Seer Mok'thardin in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Far Seer Mok'thardin of Grom'gol needs Holy Spring Water. He also wants you to kill 10 Naga Explorers.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Mok'thardin's Enchantment",lore="There is but one final reagent needed to complete the enchantment. In the south, towards the western coast, high above the bluffs, lies a Holy Spring."},
    [4117]={name="Scorching Sash",quality=2,ilvl=44,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Akiris by the Bundle'. Starts with Privateer Bloads in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 10 Bundles of Akiris Reed to Privateer Bloads in Booty Bay.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Akiris by the Bundle",lore="You looking fer work? I might have some if you're up for a little challenge. I got a friend named Groy who makes a killing selling what the naga call akiris reed: it's some kind of valuable ocean reed."},
    [4120]={name="Robe of Crystal Waters",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=32,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Curse of the Tides'. Starts with Catelyn the Blade in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Destroy the Altar of the Tides with Catelyn's Blade, kill Gazban and bring the Stone of the Tides and Catelyn's Blade back to Baron Revilgaz.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="The Curse of the Tides",lore="So you're looking for an altar of some sort? Well, I'm no expert on troll ruins like my father, but I have heard about a sunken troll city out near that island you're looking for."},
    [4121]={name="Gemmed Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hostile Takeover'. Starts with Kebok in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Retrieve 8 Tumbled Crystals and return them to Kebok in Booty Bay.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Hostile Takeover",lore="He's done it this time! Bad enough that Gelriz's muscling out the moguls who were appointed by the trade princes, now he tries to cut in on the most notorious pirate!"},
    [4130]={name="Smotts' Compass",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Facing Negolash'. Objective: Bring 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings and 5 bottles of Junglevine Wine to Captain Smotts' Lifeboat.Kill Negolash, and bring Smotts' Cutlass to Captain Smotts in Stranglethorn.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Facing Negolash",lore="Negolash is a hungry giant. When the giants destroyed our ship, Negolash went straight for my kitchen. He wasn't hungry for crew like the other giants.",proc="Equip: Increases your chance to Dodge an attack by 1.0%."},
    [4133]={name="Darkspear Cuffs",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Headhunting'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nimboya in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 20 Shrunken Heads to Nimboya at the Grom'gol Base Camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Headhunting",lore="We must find if Yenniku is dead. Slay the Bloodscalp Headhunters and take from them their Shrunken Heads. You must gather many, many heads, and I will inspect them to make sure Yenniku's head is not among them."},
    [4134]={name="Nimboya's Mystical Staff",quality=2,ilvl=46,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving Yenniku'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kin'weelay in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring the Filled Soul Gem to Nimboya.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Saving Yenniku",lore="I have reshaped the Mind's Eye into a Soul Gem. Its purpose is twofold: you must use it to stun Yenniku, and once stunned place it upon his head to entrap his soul."},
    [4137]={name="Darkspear Shoes",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Split Bone Necklace'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kin'weelay in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 25 Split Bone Necklaces to Kin'weelay at the Grom'gol Base camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Split Bone Necklace",lore="Now that you have gathered Bloodscalp trophies, I have another task for you. The Skullsplitter tribe of trolls live to the southeast, and for years we have warred with them."},
    [4139]={name="Junglewalker Sandals",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Report to Doren'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Sethman in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Speak with Lieutenant Doren.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Report to Doren",lore="Did Lieutenant Doren want you to report back to him with that patrol information?"},
    [4140]={name="Palm Frond Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=34,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bad Medicine'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sergeant Yohwa in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 7 Jungle Remedies and 1 Venom Fern Extract to Sergeant Yohwa at the Rebel Camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Bad Medicine",lore="To have a chance against Kurzen, we need his healing support neutralized. He has gathered a large number of Medicine Men who heal his forces with Jungle Remedies and poison our fighters with Venom Fern Extracts."},
    [4197]={name="Berylline Pads",quality=3,ilvl=36,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Crone of the Kraul'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="The Crone of the Kraul",lore="Poor Heralath! And this dwarf... Lonebrow. What a brave soul he was. We must not let their valiance go for naught. This crone... Charlga Razorflank..."},
