    [7106]={name="Zodiac Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Look To The Stars'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Viktori Prism'Antras in Duskwood. Objective: Locate Zzarc'Vul in the southern ogre mound in Duskwood and return his monocle to Viktori in Darkshire.",zone="Duskwood",questName="Look To The Stars",lore="Now there is just one more item needed to complete this device. Cog's blueprint calls for a lens of some sort. The only lens I know of that would be large enough will be very difficult to acquire."},
