    [22496]={name="Frostfire Robe",quality=4,ilvl=92,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Frostfire Robe'. Starts with Archmage Angela Dosantos in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Frostfire Robe if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Frostfire Robe",lore="While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
